"Your case has been received for a preliminary legal assessment by the Studio."
msgstr ""
"Your case has been received for a preliminary legal assessment by the Studio."

msgid ""
"A Studio lawyer reviews the facts and the applicable source material before "
"any indicative amount is shown. The platform publishes amounts only when "
"validated quantification sources are wired for the jurisdiction; for cross-"
"border road accident cases the Studio prefers a manual reading of the case "
"before any estimate is produced."
