msgid "Questa simulazione è un parere legale?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"No. La simulazione è una valutazione indicativa basata su fonti legali "
"validate per la giurisdizione applicabile. Non sostituisce un parere legale "
"né una perizia medico-legale; la valutazione effettiva dipende dai "
"documenti, dalla perizia e dalla legge applicabile al caso specifico."
msgstr ""

msgid "Inviare il modulo crea un incarico professionale?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"No. L'invio del modulo richiede una verifica preliminare allo Studio e non "
"costituisce un incarico professionale. L'eventuale conferimento "
"dell'incarico avviene solo dopo un accordo scritto separato tra cliente e "
"Studio."
msgstr ""

msgid "Road accident bodily injury — assisted legal pathway"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Preliminary legal assessment of road-accident bodily injury claims, based on "
"the Tabella Unica Nazionale 2025 in Italy and recognised indicative "
"references in France and Belgium. Indicative, not a guarantee of outcome."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you were injured in a road accident as a driver, passenger, cyclist or "
"pedestrian, the Studio reviews each case manually and produces a preliminary "
"indicative assessment based on validated legal sources. No automatic figure "
"is published before the underlying sources have been verified for your case."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You suffered bodily injury after a collision involving a vehicle, on a "
"public or private road."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A medical report has assessed your temporary or permanent disability, or "
"your medical course is ongoing."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The insurer of the third party has made an offer you want to verify, or no "
"offer has yet been made."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You hold or are entitled to a certificate identifying the responsible party "
"(police report, constat amiable, CAI)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Reads the available pieces (medical reports, insurance correspondence) and "
"identifies the applicable jurisdiction."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Runs the indicative simulation against the validated legal sources and "
"prepares the breakdown by head of damage."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Highlights the documents missing for a binding evaluation and the next legal "
"steps available to you."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Proposes whether and how the Studio can take the case forward — without any "
"automatic engagement."
msgstr ""

msgid "Start indicative simulation"
msgstr ""

msgid "Request a legal review instead"
msgstr ""

msgid "Devo già avere tutti i documenti per chiedere una valutazione?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"No. Si può iniziare con i documenti disponibili — verbale delle autorità o "
"constat amiable, referti medici, eventuali corrispondenze con "
"l'assicurazione. Lo Studio indica quali documenti mancano dopo la prima "
"revisione."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Ho già ricevuto un'offerta dall'assicurazione: posso chiedere una verifica?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Sì. Lo Studio può valutare l'offerta in via preliminare confrontandola con "
"le fonti indicative validate per la giurisdizione applicabile. Si consiglia "
"di non firmare alcuna transazione prima della verifica."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bodily injury claims"
msgstr ""

msgid "Bodily injury — assisted legal pathway"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Preliminary legal assessment of bodily injury claims (permanent disability, "
"temporary disability, biological damage), based on the validated legal "
"sources approved for the chosen jurisdiction. Indicative, not a guarantee of "
"outcome."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Bodily injury — sometimes referred to as biological damage — covers "
"temporary disability, permanent disability and the broader impact on your "
"life from a documented injury. The Studio reviews each case manually using "
"validated legal sources and produces a preliminary indicative assessment, "
"not a binding evaluation."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A medical-legal report has assessed your permanent disability percentage, or "
"the assessment is in progress."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You also suffered temporary disability (ITT) or partial temporary disability "
"(ITP), with documented duration."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The injury has impact on your daily life, your work capacity or your "
"relational life that you want recognised."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Reads the medical-legal report and identifies the applicable indicative "
"source (e.g. Tabella Unica Nazionale 2025 in Italy)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Computes an indicative range using validated coefficients, highlighting the "
"assumptions made and the missing documents."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Helps you understand whether the figure offered by an insurer is in line "
"with the indicative range or significantly below."
msgstr ""

msgid "Quali documenti aiutano la valutazione del danno biologico?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Il referto medico-legale che attesta la percentuale di invalidità "
"permanente, i certificati di durata della inabilità temporanea (totale o "
"parziale) e la documentazione clinica del percorso terapeutico. La "
"valutazione effettiva dipende da queste fonti."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Se il percorso medico-legale è ancora in corso, posso comunque chiedere una "
"valutazione?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Sì, ma la valutazione resta preliminare e potrà cambiare al consolidarsi del "
"quadro medico-legale. Lo Studio indica le ipotesi e i documenti ancora "
"mancanti."
msgstr ""

msgid "Insurance offer review"
msgstr ""

msgid "Insurance offer review — assisted legal pathway"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Preliminary review of insurance settlement offers in road-accident and "
"bodily-injury cases. The Studio compares the offer against validated "
"indicative sources and highlights what is missing. Indicative, not a "
"guarantee of outcome."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You received an offer from an insurance company but you are not sure whether "
"it reflects what your case is worth. The Studio reviews each offer manually, "
"compares it against validated indicative sources and gives you a preliminary "
"indicative assessment of whether to accept, negotiate or refuse. No "
"professional engagement is created by this review."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"An insurer has sent a written settlement offer and you have time to evaluate "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You want to understand whether the offer reflects the indicative range "
"supported by validated sources."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You are negotiating an offer and want a second opinion before signing "
"anything."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Important: do not sign a settlement without a legal review — once signed, "
"most counter-claims are precluded."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Reviews the offer letter and the documents you have, identifies the legal "
"basis the insurer is relying on."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Compares the offer against the validated indicative range for the case (e.g. "
"Tabella Unica Nazionale 2025 in Italy)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Indicates whether the offer is in line, below, or significantly below the "
"indicative range — and what is missing."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Recommends the next step — accept, negotiate, refuse — without any automatic "
"engagement."
msgstr ""

msgid "Request a legal review of your offer"
msgstr ""

msgid "Run the indicative simulation first"
msgstr ""

msgid "Posso firmare l'offerta prima della verifica legale?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Si consiglia di non sottoscrivere alcuna transazione prima di una verifica "
"legale. Una volta firmata, la maggior parte delle pretese ulteriori risulta "
"preclusa: la revisione preliminare aiuta a evitare rinunce non informate."
msgstr ""

msgid "La revisione dell'offerta equivale ad accettarla?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"No. La revisione è solo orientativa: lo Studio indica se l'offerta è in "
"linea con il range indicativo delle fonti validate e suggerisce se "
"accettare, negoziare o rifiutare. La decisione finale resta sempre del "
"cliente."
msgstr ""

msgid "Work injury — assisted legal pathway"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Preliminary legal assessment of work-injury claims and the interaction "
"between mandatory insurance (e.g. INAIL in Italy) and additional civil "
"liability. Indicative, not a guarantee of outcome."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Work injuries combine mandatory work-insurance coverage (e.g. INAIL in "
"Italy) with potential civil liability of the employer or third parties. The "
"Studio reviews each case manually to identify what is covered by mandatory "
"insurance, what may be claimed as additional damages, and how to document "
"the case correctly. A preliminary indicative assessment is provided after "
"that review."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You were injured during work activities, including commuting where covered "
"by law."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Mandatory work insurance has already been notified, or you need help "
"notifying it."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You believe the injury was caused or aggravated by inadequate safety "
"conditions, equipment or training."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A medical report has assessed the permanent or temporary impact, or the "
"assessment is in progress."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Identifies what is covered by mandatory work insurance and what remains for "
"civil-liability review."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Reviews the safety documentation (DVR, equipment records, training "
"certificates) for a possible additional claim."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Provides a preliminary indicative assessment of the additional damages "
"potentially recoverable."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Indicates next steps and missing documents — without any automatic "
"engagement."
msgstr ""

msgid "Request a legal review"
msgstr ""

msgid "Open the simulation wizard"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Se l'assicurazione obbligatoria (es. INAIL) copre già l'infortunio, ha senso "
"una valutazione?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Sì. La copertura obbligatoria e l'eventuale responsabilità civile del datore "
"di lavoro o di terzi sono profili distinti: la valutazione preliminare aiuta "
"a individuare quanto potrebbe restare esigibile in via civilistica, oltre "
"alla copertura obbligatoria."
msgstr ""

msgid "Quali documenti aiutano la valutazione di un infortunio sul lavoro?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"La denuncia di infortunio, gli eventuali verbali ispettivi, la "
"documentazione clinica e, quando disponibile, la documentazione di sicurezza "
"relativa alla mansione (es. DVR, registri di formazione)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Medical malpractice — assisted legal pathway"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Preliminary legal assessment of medical-malpractice claims. The Studio "
"reviews the clinical documentation and identifies whether a medico-legal "
"expert assessment is the right next step. Indicative, not a guarantee of "
"outcome."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Medical-malpractice cases require a clinical assessment of the treatment "
"received and a legal assessment of whether a deviation from the standard of "
"care has caused harm. The Studio reviews the available clinical "
"documentation, identifies whether an independent medico-legal expert is the "
"right next step, and produces a preliminary indicative assessment. This page "
"is informational; it does not constitute a clinical or legal opinion."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You believe a medical or surgical treatment caused an avoidable harm, or the "
"harm was not adequately explained to you."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You have at least partial clinical documentation (discharge letters, exam "
"results, surgical reports)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You want to understand whether commissioning an independent medico-legal "
"expert assessment is justified."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Reviews the clinical documentation you have and identifies the relevant "
"medical-legal framework."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Helps you understand whether commissioning an independent medico-legal "
"expert is justified, and at what cost."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Produces a preliminary indicative assessment of the recoverable categories "
"of damage."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Recommends next steps and the documents you should gather for a complete "
"review."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Serve già una perizia medico-legale indipendente per chiedere la valutazione?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Non necessariamente in questa fase. Lo Studio aiuta a capire se "
"commissionare una perizia indipendente è giustificato, e con quale ordine di "
"costo, prima di qualsiasi avvio formale."
msgstr ""

msgid "Una perizia indipendente è sempre obbligatoria?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Non sempre. Dipende dalla documentazione clinica disponibile e dalla "
"complessità del caso. Lo Studio valuta caso per caso prima di consigliare un "
"esborso ulteriore."
msgstr ""

msgid "Death of a relative"
msgstr ""

msgid "Death of a relative — assisted legal pathway"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Preliminary legal assessment of damage claims following the death of a "
"relative — loss of the parental / family relationship, patrimonial damage, "
"mandatory insurance coverage. Indicative, not a guarantee of outcome."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The death of a close relative may give rise to compensation for the loss of "
"the parental or family relationship and for patrimonial damage suffered by "
"the surviving family. The Studio reviews each case manually with the "
"sensitivity it requires and produces a preliminary indicative assessment. "
"The Studio does not publish any automatic figure before reading the "
"documents."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A close relative has died as a consequence of an accident, of a medical "
"event, or of work circumstances."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You want to understand whether and how the loss can be assessed under the "
"relevant legal framework."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You are dealing with the insurer of a third party and want a second opinion "
"before any agreement."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You hold at least basic documentation about the cause of death and the "
"family link."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Reads the documentation, identifies the applicable jurisdiction and the "
"recoverable categories of damage."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Produces a preliminary indicative assessment based on validated indicative "
"sources for the relevant family relationships."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Indicates next steps, missing documents and the alternatives available to "
"the family."
msgstr ""

msgid "Handles the matter with the discretion the case requires."
msgstr ""

msgid "Quali familiari possono chiedere la valutazione?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"La valutazione orientativa è disponibile per i familiari direttamente "
"coinvolti dalla perdita. Lo Studio identifica caso per caso quali categorie "
"di danno risultano applicabili in base al rapporto familiare documentato."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Posso chiedere una verifica se è già in corso una trattativa con "
"l'assicurazione?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Sì, è anzi consigliato. Una seconda opinione orientativa prima di accordi o "
"sottoscrizioni aiuta a evitare rinunce non informate che potrebbero "
"precludere ulteriori pretese."
msgstr ""

msgid "Foreign citizens injured in Italy"
msgstr ""

msgid "Foreign citizens injured in Italy — assisted legal pathway"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Preliminary legal assessment for foreign citizens who suffered a road-"
"accident, work-injury or medical injury during a stay or residence in Italy. "
"Multilingual handling (IT / FR / EN / AR). Indicative, not a guarantee of "
"outcome."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Foreign citizens injured during a stay or residence in Italy face a specific "
"procedural picture: notification to the Italian insurer, language barriers, "
"evidence collection across countries. The Studio handles the case "
"multilingually (Italian, French, English, Arabic) and produces a preliminary "
"indicative assessment after reading the documents."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You are not an Italian resident but you suffered an accident or harm during "
"a stay in Italy."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You need to communicate with an Italian insurer or with Italian medical "
"structures."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Your medical records or police reports are in Italian and you want them "
"reviewed in your own language."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You are unsure whether to pursue the case in Italy or in your country of "
"residence."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Communicates in your own language and translates the procedural "
"correspondence where needed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Identifies the applicable jurisdiction, applicable law and competent court."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Produces a preliminary indicative assessment of recoverable damages under "
"Italian indicative sources."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Coordinates with local counsel in your country of residence if cross-border "
"execution is needed."
msgstr ""

msgid "Request a multilingual legal review"
msgstr ""

msgid "In quale lingua posso comunicare con lo Studio?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Lo Studio gestisce italiano, francese, inglese e arabo. La documentazione "
"clinica e procedurale italiana viene letta e tradotta nelle parti rilevanti "
"per il caso."
msgstr ""

msgid "Devo necessariamente avviare la causa in Italia?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Non sempre. La giurisdizione competente dipende dai fatti, dalla legge "
"applicabile e dai trattati: la valutazione preliminare include questo passo "
"di triage prima di qualsiasi avvio formale."
msgstr ""

msgid "Cross-border cases"
msgstr ""

msgid "Cross-border legal cases — assisted legal pathway"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Preliminary legal assessment of cases with cross-border elements: "
"international inheritance (Morocco, Tunisia), road accidents abroad, and "
"disputes involving parties in different countries. Indicative, not a "
"guarantee of outcome."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When a case involves parties or assets across multiple countries — a road "
"accident abroad, an inheritance opened in another jurisdiction, a contract "
"dispute under foreign law — the first step is identifying the applicable law "
"and the competent court. The Studio reviews each case manually and produces "
"a preliminary indicative assessment after that triage."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"An accident occurred abroad and you are pursuing damages from your country "
"of residence."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"An inheritance has been opened in another jurisdiction (e.g. Morocco, "
"Tunisia) with assets or heirs in Europe."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Parties to your case are residents of different countries and you do not "
"know which law applies."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Documents you need to use are in foreign languages and need to be reviewed "
"by counsel familiar with both jurisdictions."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Identifies the applicable conflict-of-laws rules, the competent jurisdiction "
"and any treaty framework."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Translates / interprets foreign documents and correspondence and coordinates "
"with local counsel."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Produces a preliminary indicative assessment of the most likely "
"jurisdictional outcome."
msgstr ""

msgid "Recommends a structured next step — without any automatic engagement."
msgstr ""

msgid "Request a cross-border legal review"
msgstr ""

msgid "Come si stabilisce quale legge si applica al caso?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Attraverso le regole di conflitto e i trattati internazionali rilevanti per "
"il caso. Lo Studio individua il quadro applicabile prima di formulare una "
"stima orientativa dell'esito."
msgstr ""

msgid "Lo Studio collabora con avvocati locali nei paesi coinvolti?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Sì. Quando l'esecuzione transfrontaliera richiede l'intervento di un legale "
"locale, lo Studio si coordina con corrispondenti nei paesi rilevanti per il "
"caso."
msgstr ""

msgid "Indicative estimate in a few clicks"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Answer a short, optional set of questions. Where an official validated "
"source exists, you immediately see an indicative min / mid / max range with "
"the sources behind it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Share your documents"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you decide to go further, you send the relevant documents. None are "
"required for the first orientation; the Studio asks for what it needs after "
"reading the case."
msgstr ""

msgid "Free preliminary assessment"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A lawyer reviews your request manually and replies on whether and how the "
"Studio can help. The preliminary assessment is free and without obligation."
msgstr ""

msgid "Source and formula verification"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When a calculation is available, it is checked against the official source "
"and the approved formula. When it is not, we say so explicitly rather than "
"invent a number."
msgstr ""

msgid "Professional evaluation"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Where appropriate, the Studio carries out a full legal evaluation — medical-"
"legal aspects, liability, applicable law and competent jurisdiction."
msgstr ""

msgid "Written engagement, only if you choose"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A professional engagement begins solely with a separate written agreement. "
"Fees follow the applicable rules and the forensic code of conduct."
msgstr ""

msgid "Road accident"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Bodily injury from a road accident. Where the case fits the official Tabella "
"Unica Nazionale 2025, the platform produces an indicative range; otherwise "
"the Studio reviews it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Calculate the estimate"
msgstr ""

msgid "Medical liability"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Suspected medical or healthcare malpractice. These cases hinge on expert "
"evidence and are assessed by the Studio — no automatic figure is published."
msgstr ""

msgid "Request a preliminary assessment"
msgstr ""

msgid "Workplace injury"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Accidents at work and occupational disease, including the differential "
"beyond INAIL. Reviewed by the Studio; not automatically calculated today."
msgstr ""

msgid "Loss of a relative"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Death and loss-of-relationship damages for family members. A sensitive, fact-"
"specific area handled directly by the Studio."
msgstr ""

msgid "Insurance / INAIL offer to check"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You received a settlement or INAIL offer. The Studio can review whether it "
"is adequate before you sign — do not accept a settlement without a "
"professional review."
msgstr ""

msgid "Have your offer reviewed"
msgstr ""

msgid "Cross-border matters"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Cases with foreign elements — parties, assets or events abroad — including "
"questions of applicable law and competent jurisdiction."
msgstr ""

msgid "Foreign nationals in Italy"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Assistance for foreign or non-resident clients who suffered harm in Italy, "
"with multilingual support and remote handling."
msgstr ""

msgid "Foreign / consular documents"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Help with documentation produced abroad — translation, legalisation and "
"consular formalities needed to support a claim."
msgstr ""

msgid "Is the estimate binding?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"No. It is an indicative orientation based on validated official sources — "
"not a quote, a verdict or a promise. The amount actually awarded depends on "
"documents, expert reports, liability, the applicable law and the deciding "
"court."
msgstr ""

msgid "Can I calculate any case?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"No. An automatic estimate appears only where an official, validated source "
"and formula exist — today, road-accident bodily injury in Italy on the "
"Tabella Unica Nazionale 2025. For everything else the platform asks for a "
"preliminary assessment instead of inventing a number."
msgstr ""

msgid "Why are some countries not calculable?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Because a figure is published only when the underlying legal source has been "
"validated. For France, Belgium, Morocco and Tunisia the sources are "
"catalogued but not yet validated, so no automatic amount is shown and the "
"Studio reviews those cases manually."
msgstr ""

msgid "What documents are needed?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For a first orientation, none. For a real assessment the Studio typically "
"asks for medical records, accident or incident reports, insurance "
"correspondence and proof of economic impact. A checklist is shown after each "
"simulation."
msgstr ""

msgid "I already received an offer — can I have it checked?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Yes. The Studio can review an insurance or INAIL offer before you accept it. "
"Do not sign a settlement before a professional review: reopening it "
"afterwards can be difficult."
msgstr ""

msgid "Can I be assisted if I live abroad?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Yes. The Studio handles cross-border matters and assists clients living "
"outside Italy, in several languages. A preliminary assessment can be "
"requested remotely."
msgstr ""

msgid "Is a medical-legal report needed?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For permanent injury, a medical-legal assessment is usually decisive for the "
"final valuation. The platform can produce an indicative range without it, "
"but it does not replace the report."
msgstr ""

msgid "Is the preliminary assessment free?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The preliminary assessment of your request is free and without obligation. A "
"professional engagement begins only with a separate written agreement."
msgstr ""

msgid "Does this site replace legal advice?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"No. It is an informational tool. It does not constitute legal or medical-"
"legal advice and does not guarantee any outcome. For a binding opinion, "
"request a professional evaluation."
msgstr ""

msgid "How is my personal data handled?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Your data is processed only with your explicit consent, for the stated "
"purpose, under the GDPR. Special-category data (health, income, family) is "
"processed under art. 9 only after a dedicated consent. See the privacy "
"notice for details."
msgstr ""

msgid "Indicative calculation available"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"An indicative calculation is available, based on the verified national "
"dataset for the chosen jurisdiction."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Indicative simulation based on the verified national dataset. The Studio "
"remains available to review the case and discuss the next step."
msgstr ""

msgid "Run an indicative simulation"
msgstr ""

msgid "Request a Studio review of this case"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Studio offers a preliminary legal assessment for this country: each case "
"is reviewed manually and no automatic amount is published before the "
"underlying quantification sources have been verified."
msgstr ""

